  "method": "Every tracked C# file was read line by line. The two families directive 0078 names as false positives are excluded before any pattern is applied, so IsolationLevel.Serializable as a transaction level and JsonSerializableAttribute as the System.Text.Json source generator marker cannot enter the count.",
