  "finding": "The load bearing constructs of formatter based serialization are all at zero: no SerializationInfo, no StreamingContext, no ISerializable implementation and no formatter type anywhere in the repository. What remains is 157 bare [Serializable] markings on exception types, message contracts and a few value types. An exception marked that way used to also carry a protected constructor taking SerializationInfo and StreamingContext, and none exists, so every one of those markings is already inert metadata that no retained serializer reads.",
  "disposition": "The flag emitted by DynamicImplementationBuilder and its SYSLIB0050 suppression are removed, which is what this section ordered. Removing the 157 inert attributes is a separate sweep over public types and is not part of this order; it is reported here rather than done quietly.",
